  "title": "Steakhouse Potatoes Romanoff",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s potatoes Romanoff feature shredded potatoes fluffed up with sour cream and Cheddar cheese. Serve it as a holiday gratin or steak side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
