  "ingredients": [
    "1 teaspoon butter, or as needed",
    "3 large russet potatoes, scrubbed",
    "0.25 cup minced shallots",
    "3 teaspoons kosher salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon freshly ground white pepper",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper, or to taste",
    "2.5 cups grated sharp white Cheddar cheese",
    "1.75 cups sour cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap each potato in aluminum foil; place on a baking sheet. Poke holes in potatoes using a small knife.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XotZvn6v9ExjKTag7ignT1RkpDE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276526-SteakhousePotatoesRomanoff-mfs-step1-1335-cbae49e088c742adb82c38d91977e728.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276526/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until potatoes are very tender and easily pierced with a knife, about 1 hour and 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7PbjlONKWxA99WFhWBTFux9OS1E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276526-SteakhousePotatoesRomanoff-mfs-Step2-1397-c0c968ceb7c643f5889541040ecf48b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276526/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let potatoes cool to room temperature. Unwrap; place potatoes on a plate. Cover the plate with plastic wrap; refrigerate until completely chilled, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Butter a casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Shred potatoes (with skins on) into a large bowl using a cheese grater. Add shallots potatoes, salt, white pepper, and cayenne pepper; toss with two forks until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y2gFEKcjHyjLPFJnh55ecnWq0I4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276526-SteakhousePotatoesRomanoff-mfs-Step3-1539-b8d94a3d73524cd181f689ad2908f2f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276526/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add Cheddar cheese; mix well. Gently toss in sour cream until barely combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/__o9EDY-Rpw-K9hgjB7CdIrZCDI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276526-SteakhousePotatoesRomanoff-mfs-Step4-1542-3deb9e686efa4762be52e8867c8539a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276526/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to the prepared baking dish, piling it high, then patting it down very lightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FNoNvOQmoc9lIzl94sG54l0GUa4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276526-SteakhousePotatoesRomanoff-mfs-Step5-1549-52e5baf91ac74d82ad6a13335b2b1b2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276526/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until piping hot and the top is browned, 30 to 35 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EyfwsmqKT64l0yBVyax3ak3LUks=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276526-steakhouse-potatoes-romanoff-DDMFS-4x3-8db54289008a49e0a8202e1b16bfafca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276526/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
